# personal files
*.jpeg
WhatsApp*
_*.png

# NOTE: the raw-exports rule must stay anchored as "/assets" (root only).
# A bare "assets/" pattern also matches public/assets/ and silently keeps
# every new site image out of git — which is exactly what broke production
# (missing phase-3 pic, community screenshots and the smoke texture).
